# Local work, logs, and secrets.
# work/* keeps jobs and scratch out of git. The CC0 Komiku demo metadata
# is the exception: study JSON and attribution are tracked. Stem audio and
# the FMA source mix stay on R2 (see work/demo-a-good-bass-for-gambling/SHIP.md).
work/*
!work/demo-a-good-bass-for-gambling/
work/demo-a-good-bass-for-gambling/stems/
